{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالضُّحَى","d":"wal-ḍuḥā","e":"By the morning brightness"}],"a":{"g":"By the morning brightness"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَاللَّيْلِ","d":"wa-al-layli","e":"And the night"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"سَجَى","d":"sajā","e":"it covers with darkness"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness,"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"وَدَّعَكَ","d":"waddaʿaka","e":"has forsaken you"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"قَلَى","d":"qalā","e":"He is displeased"}],"a":{"g":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you]."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَلْءَاخِرَةُ","d":"walalākhiratu","e":"And surely the Hereafter"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"(is) better"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"for you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"than"},{"c":"الْأُولَى","d":"l-ūlā","e":"the first"}],"a":{"g":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life]."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَسَوْفَ","d":"walasawfa","e":"And soon"},{"c":"يُعْطِيكَ","d":"yuʿ'ṭīka","e":"will give you"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"فَتَرْضَى","d":"fatarḍā","e":"then you will be satisfied"}],"a":{"g":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"يَجِدْكَ","d":"yajid'ka","e":"He find you"},{"c":"يَتِيمًا","d":"yatīman","e":"an orphan"},{"c":"فءَاوَى","d":"faāwā","e":"and gave shelter"}],"a":{"g":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge?"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَوَجَدَكَ","d":"wawajadaka","e":"And He found you"},{"c":"ضَالًّا","d":"ḍāllan","e":"lost"},{"c":"فَهَدَى","d":"fahadā","e":"so He guided"}],"a":{"g":"And He found you lost and guided [you],"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَوَجَدَكَ","d":"wawajadaka","e":"And He found you"},{"c":"عَائِلًا","d":"ʿāilan","e":"in need"},{"c":"فَأَغْنَى","d":"fa-aghnā","e":"so He made self-sufficient"}],"a":{"g":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"So as for"},{"c":"الْيَتِيمَ","d":"l-yatīma","e":"the orphan"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"then (do) not"},{"c":"تَقْهَرْ","d":"taqhar","e":"oppress"}],"a":{"g":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him]."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"And as for"},{"c":"السَّائِلَ","d":"l-sāila","e":"him who asks"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"then (do) not"},{"c":"تَنْهَرْ","d":"tanhar","e":"repel"}],"a":{"g":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him]."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But as for"},{"c":"بِنِعْمَةِ","d":"biniʿ'mati","e":"(the) Favor"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"فَحَدِّثْ","d":"faḥaddith","e":"narrate"}],"a":{"g":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it]."}}}